{"id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-McGee.md","title":"McGee 的 NEC 与三条弱组合条件导致 ω 不一致","display":"thm-McGee — McGee 的 NEC 与三条弱组合条件导致 ω 不一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-McGee","aliases":["91-thm-McGee"],"display":"thm-McGee — McGee 的 NEC 与三条弱组合条件导致 ω 不一致","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-omega-consistency]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-McGee"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-McGee</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-McGee — McGee 的 NEC 与三条弱组合条件导致 ω 不一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ad5058535b9125d\" href=\"?note=8ad5058535b9125d\" title=\"91-df-omega-consistency\">91-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为经典理论，能自然表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句法，且对所有无假设的定理闭于 NEC（capture）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(0,a)=a\">\\(f(0,a)=a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n+1,a)=\\operatorname{TrNum}(f(n,a))\">\\(f(n+1,a)=\\operatorname{TrNum}(f(n,a))\\)</span>，取其自然对象表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 是对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,x))\">\\(\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,x))\\)</span> 的对角句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明下列三句：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\to\\neg T(a)))\">\\(\\forall a(D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\to\\neg T(a)))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\forall b(D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(a)\\lor T(b))))\">\\(\\forall a\\forall b(D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(a)\\lor T(b))))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\forall a(D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))\\to T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))))\">\\(\\forall v\\forall a(D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))\\to T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})),\n\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[S\\vdash T(f(\\overline k,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})),\n\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[S\\vdash T(f(\\overline k,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对角式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\">\\(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\)</span> 经 NEC、弱析取子句和否定单向子句，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\urcorner})\\)</span>。量词子句与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的递归将其变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\gamma\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\gamma\\)</span>。\n另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\gamma\\to\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg\\gamma\\to\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span>。经典逻辑遂证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，由对角式得到上面的否定全称。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 反复 NEC 得每个标准实例，构成 ω 不一致性见证。\n该定理不需要 CONEC；也不声称这些弱条件已导致句法不一致。FS 满足全部前提，因此是它的特例。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 13.9 及完整证明，印刷页 143–144，PDF 页 154–155。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"8ad5058535b9125d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"f(0,a)=a","display":false},{"tex":"f(n+1,a)=\\operatorname{TrNum}(f(n,a))","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,x))","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a(D(a)\\to(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\to\\neg T(a)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\forall b(D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T(a)\\lor T(b))))","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall v\\forall a(D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))\\to T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\\quad\nS\\vdash\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})),\n\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[S\\vdash T(f(\\overline k,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\gamma\\to\\forall n\\,T(f(n,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}))\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2217,"backlinks":[{"id":"6490c20309820655","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cda20fabbaa06580","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-McGee]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["38c8